{"unit_id":2,"stage_id":2,"lesson":{"lesson_id":8,"lesson_key":"S2L8","stage_id":2,"title":"Harf-e-Nafy-e-Jins 'Laa' (Koi ... nahin): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Nafy-e-Jins 'Laa' (Koi ... nahin): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ","en":"Categorical Negation 'Laa' (No / None): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ","ur":"حرفِ نفی جنس 'لَا' (کوئی نہیں): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-नफ़ी-ए-जिंस 'ला' (कोई ... नहीं): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ"},"arabic_Focus":"كِتَابٌ ، رَيْبٌ ، إِكْرَاهٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ ، لَا رَيْبَ ، لَا إِكْرَاهَ","hinglish_Focus":"Ek kitaab, shak, zabardasti (ـٌ) → Koi kitaab nahin, koi shak nahin, koi zabardasti nahin (ـَ)","page_numbers":"66–67","book_page":66,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"كِتَابٌ ، رَيْبٌ ، إِكْرَاهٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ ، لَا رَيْبَ ، لَا إِكْرَاهَ","hinglish":"Ek kitaab, shak, zabardasti (ـٌ) → Koi kitaab nahin, koi shak nahin, koi zabardasti nahin (ـَ)","arabic_word":"كِتَابٌ ، رَيْبٌ ، إِكْرَاهٌ","arabic_combined":"كِتَابٌ ، رَيْبٌ ، إِكْرَاهٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ ، لَا رَيْبَ ، لَا إِكْرَاهَ","hinglish_word":"Ek kitaab, shak, zabardasti (ـٌ)","hinglish_combined":"Ek kitaab, shak, zabardasti (ـٌ) → Koi kitaab nahin, koi shak nahin, koi zabardasti nahin (ـَ)","title_en":"Harf-e-Nafy-e-Jins 'Laa' (Koi ... nahin): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ","subtitle":"Unit 2 • Lesson 8 (Book Page 66–67)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"كِتَابٌ ، رَيْبٌ ، إِكْرَاهٌ","after_ar":"لَا كِتَابَ ، لَا رَيْبَ ، لَا إِكْرَاهَ","before_hi":"Ek kitaab, shak, zabardasti (ـٌ)","after_hi":"Koi kitaab nahin, koi shak nahin, koi zabardasti nahin (ـَ)"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S2L8 — Harf-e-Nafy-e-Jins 'Laa' (Koi ... nahin): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S2L8 — Harf-e-Nafy-e-Jins 'Laa' (Koi ... nahin): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qaa'ida / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["لَا + Ism (Ek Zabar ـَ)","لَا رَيْبَ / لَا إِكْرَاهَ / لَا خَوْفَ / لَا ظُلْمَ","Koi shak nahin / Koi zabardasti nahin / Koi zulm nahin"],["فَلَا / وَلَا + Ism","فَلَا خَوْفَ / وَلَا جِدَالَ فِي الْحَجِّ","Pas koi khauf nahin / Aur Hajj mein koi jhagda nahin"],["Qur'ani Qaanoon","لَا إِكْرَاهَ فِي الدِّينِ / ذَٰلِكَ الْكِتَابُ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهِ","Deen mein koi zabardasti nahin / Yeh woh Kitaab hai jismein koi shak nahin"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 8</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Nafy-e-Jins 'Laa' (Koi ... nahin): كِتَابٌ ← لَا كِتَابَ (Page 66–67)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كِتَابٌ ، رَيْبٌ ، إِكْرَاهٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Laa Nafy-e-Jins (لَا + ـَ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">لَا كِتَابَ ، لَا رَيْبَ ، لَا إِكْرَاهَ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• كِتَابٌ ، رَيْبٌ ، إِكْرَاهٌ (Ek kitaab, shak, zabardasti (ـٌ)) se لَا كِتَابَ ، لَا رَيْبَ ، لَا إِكْرَاهَ (Koi kitaab nahin, koi shak nahin, koi zabardasti nahin (ـَ)) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 66–67):** Kisi cheez ki mukammal nafi (**'Koi ... nahin'**) karne ke liye baghair `الْـ` wale ism se pehle **`لَا`** lagaya jata hai, aur us ism ke aakhir par Tanween ke bajaye **sirf ek Zabar (`ـَ`)** aata hai: `رَيْبٌ ← لَا رَيْبَ` (koi shak nahin), `إِكْرَاهٌ ← لَا إِكْرَاهَ فِي الدِّينِ` (deen mein koi zabardasti nahin)."}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Arabi mein kisi cheez ke wujood ki mukammal nafi (inkaar) ke liye usse pehle (لَا) lagaya jata hai. (لَا) na sirf agle lafz ki mukammal nafi karta hai, balki us lafz ki tamaam harakat hata kar aakhir mein sirf ek zabar (fathah ــَ) chhodta hai. Yeh misaal mein dekha ja sakta hai. Yeh English ke (not at all / never ever) ya Urdu ke 'hargiz nahi / bilkul nahi' jaisa hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"• Ab aap darj zail Qur'ani fiqron ko aasaani se khud samajh aur tarjuma kar sakte hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_g5","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l8_g5_w1","arabic":"لَا ظُلْمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ظُلْمَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi zulm nahin","translations":{"en":"No injustice","ur":"کوئی ظلم نہیں","hi":"कोई ज़ुल्म नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w2","arabic":"لَا عِلْمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi ilm nahin","translations":{"en":"No knowledge","ur":"کوئی علم نہیں","hi":"कोई इल्म नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w3","arabic":"لَا إِلٰهَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلٰهَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi ilah nahin","translations":{"en":"No deity","ur":"کوئی معبود نہیں","hi":"कोई माबूद नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w4","arabic":"لَا شَرِيكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَرِيكَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi shareek nahin","translations":{"en":"No partner","ur":"کوئی شریک نہیں","hi":"कोई शरीक नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w5","arabic":"لَا تَبْدِيلَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَبْدِيلَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi tabdeeli nahin","translations":{"en":"No change","ur":"کوئی تبدیلی نہیں","hi":"कोई तब्दीली नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w6","arabic":"لَا خَيْرَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi bhalai nahin","translations":{"en":"No good","ur":"کوئی بھلائی نہیں","hi":"कोई भलाई नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w7","arabic":"لَا قُوَّةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قُوَّةَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi quwwat nahin","translations":{"en":"No strength","ur":"کوئی قوت نہیں","hi":"कोई क़ुव्वत नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w8","arabic":"لَا إِكْرَاهَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِكْرَاهَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi zabardasti nahin","translations":{"en":"No compulsion","ur":"کوئی زبردستی نہیں","hi":"कोई ज़बरदस्ती नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w9","arabic":"لَا حُجَّةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حُجَّةَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi daleel nahin","translations":{"en":"No argument / No dispute","ur":"کوئی دلیل نہیں","hi":"कोई दलील नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w10","arabic":"لَا غَالِبَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَالِبَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi ghalib nahin","translations":{"en":"No victor / None can overcome","ur":"کوئی غالب نہیں","hi":"कोई ग़ालिब नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w11","arabic":"لَا بُرْهَانَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بُرْهَانَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi daleel nahin","translations":{"en":"No proof / No evidence","ur":"کوئی برہان نہیں / کوئی دلیل نہیں","hi":"कोई बुरहान नहीं / कोई दलील नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w12","arabic":"لَا بُشْرَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بُشْرَى</span>","hinglish":"Koi khushkhabri nahin","translations":{"en":"No glad tidings","ur":"کوئی خوشخبری نہیں","hi":"कोई ख़ुशख़बरी नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w13","arabic":"لَا مَوْلَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَوْلَى</span>","hinglish":"Koi dost nahin","translations":{"en":"No protector / No helper","ur":"کوئی مددگار نہیں / کوئی دوست نہیں","hi":"कोई मददगार नहीं / कोई दोस्त नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w14","arabic":"لَا طَاقَةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">طَاقَةَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi taqat nahin","translations":{"en":"No strength","ur":"کوئی طاقت نہیں","hi":"कोई ताक़त नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w15","arabic":"لَا جِدَالَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جِدَالَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi jhagda nahin","translations":{"en":"No disputing","ur":"کوئی جھگڑا نہیں","hi":"कोई झगड़ा नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w16","arabic":"لَا فُسُوقَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فُسُوقَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi gunah nahin","translations":{"en":"No wickedness / No disobedience","ur":"کوئی گناہ نہیں / کوئی نافرمانی نہیں","hi":"कोई गुनाह नहीं / कोई नाफ़रमानी नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w17","arabic":"لَا رَيْبَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَيْبَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi shak nahin","translations":{"en":"No doubt","ur":"کوئی شک نہیں","hi":"कोई शक नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w18","arabic":"لَا جَرَمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَرَمَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi shak nahin","translations":{"en":"Undoubtedly / No doubt","ur":"کوئی شک نہیں (یقیناً)","hi":"कोई शक नहीं (यक़ीनन)"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w19","arabic":"لَا مُبَدِّلَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُبَدِّلَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi badalne wala nahin","translations":{"en":"None can change / No changer","ur":"کوئی بدلنے والا نہیں","hi":"कोई बदलने वाला नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g5_w20","arabic":"لَا عَاصِمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَاصِمَ</span>","hinglish":"Koi bachane wala nahin","translations":{"en":"No protector / No savior","ur":"کوئی بچانے والا نہیں","hi":"कोई बचाने वाला नहीं"}}]}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_r6","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Agar (لَا) ko (فَـ : toh / pas) ke saath milaya jaye, toh (فَلَا) ka matlab hota hai 'toh bilkul nahi / toh hargiz nahi' (then/so not at all)."}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_g7","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l8_g7_w1","arabic":"فَلَا كُفْرَانَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كُفْرَانَ</span>","hinglish":"Toh koi nashukri nahin","translations":{"en":"So there is no rejection","ur":"تو کوئی ناشکری نہیں","hi":"तो कोई नाशुक्री नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g7_w2","arabic":"فَلَا نَاصِرَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَاصِرَ</span>","hinglish":"Toh koi madadgar nahin","translations":{"en":"So there is no helper","ur":"تو کوئی مددگار نہیں","hi":"तो कोई मददगार नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g7_w3","arabic":"فَلَا جُنَاحَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جُنَاحَ</span>","hinglish":"Toh koi gunah nahin","translations":{"en":"So there is no blame","ur":"تو کوئی گناہ نہیں","hi":"तो कोई गुनाह नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g7_w4","arabic":"فَلَا إِثْمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِثْمَ</span>","hinglish":"Toh koi gunah nahin","translations":{"en":"So there is no sin","ur":"تو کوئی گناہ نہیں","hi":"तो कोई गुनाह नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g7_w5","arabic":"فَلَا رَفَثَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَفَثَ</span>","hinglish":"Toh koi behayai nahin","translations":{"en":"So there is no obscenity","ur":"تو کوئی بےحیائی نہیں","hi":"तो कोई बेहयाई नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g7_w6","arabic":"فَلَا عُدْوَانَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عُدْوَانَ</span>","hinglish":"Toh koi zulm nahin","translations":{"en":"So there is no transgression / hostility","ur":"تو کوئی ظلم (زیادتی) نہیں","hi":"तो कोई ज़ुल्म (ज़्यादती) नहीं"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_g8","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Allah ki hidayat aur uski rehmat se, ab tak padhe gaye asbaaq ki roshni mein, ab aap darj zail Qur'ani jumlon aur aayaton ko khud samajhne aur tarjuma karne ke qaabil hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_s9","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l8_s9_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"لَا إِكْرَاهَ فِي الدِّينِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا إِكْرَاهَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي الدِّينِ</span>","hinglish":"Deen mein koi zabardasti nahin","translations":{"en":"There is no doubt in it","ur":"اس میں بالکل کوئی شک نہیں","hi":"इसमें बिल्कुल कोई शक नहीं"},"ref":"2:256"},{"id":"s2l8_s9_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"لَا ظُلْمَ الْيَوْمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا ظُلْمَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْيَوْمَ</span>","hinglish":"Aaj koi zulm nahin","translations":{"en":"There is no compulsion in religion","ur":"دین میں کوئی زبردستی نہیں","hi":"दीन में कोई ज़बरदस्ती नहीं"},"ref":"40:17"},{"id":"s2l8_s9_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"لَا عَاصِمَ الْيَوْمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا عَاصِمَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْيَوْمَ</span>","hinglish":"Aaj koi bachane wala nahin","translations":{"en":"There is no deity except Allah","ur":"اللہ کے سوا کوئی معبود نہیں","hi":"अल्लाह के सिवा कोई माबूद नहीं"},"ref":"11:43"},{"id":"s2l8_s9_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"وَلَا جِدَالَ فِي الْحَجِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">وَلَا جِدَالَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي الْحَجِّ</span>","hinglish":"Aur hajj mein koi jhagda nahin","translations":{"en":"There is no changing the words of Allah","ur":"اللہ کی باتوں کو کوئی بدلنے والا نہیں","hi":"अल्लाह की बातों को कोई बदलने वाला नहीं"},"ref":"2:197"},{"id":"s2l8_s9_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"وَلَا فُسُوقَ وَلَا جِدَالَ فِي الْحَجِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">وَلَا فُسُوقَ وَلَا جِدَالَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي الْحَجِّ</span>","hinglish":"Aur hajj mein na koi gunah hai aur na koi jhagda","translations":{"en":"There is no fault upon the blind","ur":"اندھے پر کوئی حرج (گناہ) نہیں","hi":"अंधे पर कोई हर्ज (गुनाह) नहीं"},"ref":"2:197"}]}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_lbl10","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Exercise"}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_lbl11","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Q-1 Darj zail Qur'ani aayaton mein us hisse ko pehchaniye jahan (لَا) agle lafz ki mukammal nafi kar raha hai, aur aap use khud samajh rahe hain:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_v12","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l8_v12_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"سُبْحَانَكَ لَا عِلْمَ لَنَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سُبْحَانَكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَنَا</span>","hinglish":"Tu pak hai, hamare liye koi ilm nahin","translations":{"ur":"آج کوئی ظلم نہیں ہوگا","en":"No injustice today!","hi":"आज कोई ज़ुल्म नहीं होगा"},"ref":"2:32"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"لَا إِكْرَاهَ فِي الدِّينِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا إِكْرَاهَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي الدِّينِ</span>","hinglish":"Deen mein koi zabardasti nahin","translations":{"en":"We have no knowledge","ur":"ہمیں کچھ علم نہیں","hi":"हमें कुछ इल्म नहीं"},"ref":"2:256"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"لَا طَاقَةَ لَنَا الْيَوْمَ بِجَالُوتَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">طَاقَةَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَنَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْيَوْمَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بِجَالُوتَ</span>","hinglish":"Aaj hamare paas Jalut ke muqable ki koi taqat nahin","translations":{"en":"There is no altering the creation of Allah","ur":"اللہ کی بنائی ہوئی فطرت (تخلیق) میں کوئی تبدیلی نہیں","hi":"अल्लाह की बनाई हुई तख़लीक़ में कोई तब्दीली नहीं"},"ref":"2:249"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"اللَّهُ رَبُّكُمْ لَا إِلٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُكُمْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلٰهَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَّا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هُوَ</span>","hinglish":"Allah tumhara Rabb hai, uske siwa koi ilah nahin","translations":{"ur":"ان کی اکثر خفیہ باتوں میں کوئی بھلائی نہیں","en":"There is no good in most of their secret talks","hi":"उनकी अक्सर ख़ुफ़िया बातों में कोई भलाई नहीं"},"ref":"6:102"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"ذٰلِكَ الْكِتَابُ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ذٰلِكَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">كِتَابُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَيْبَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهِ</span>","hinglish":"Yeh kitab hai, is mein koi shak nahin","translations":{"ur":"اللہ کے سوا کوئی طاقت نہیں","en":"There is no power except with Allah","hi":"अल्लाह के सिवा कोई ताक़त नहीं"},"ref":"2:2"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"لَا تَبْدِيلَ لِخَلْقِ اللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَبْدِيلَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">خَلْقِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah ki khalaqat mein koi tabdeeli nahin","translations":{"ur":"ہمارے اور تمہارے درمیان کوئی حجت بازی نہیں","en":"There is no argument between us and you","hi":"हमारे और तुम्हारे दरमियान कोई हुज्जतबाज़ी नहीं"},"ref":"30:30"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"وَأَنَّ الْكَافِرِينَ لَا مَوْلَى لَهُمْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأَنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكَافِر</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ِينَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَوْلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَهُمْ</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak kafiron ke liye koi dost nahin","translations":{"ur":"تو تم پر کوئی غالب آنے والا نہیں","en":"Then none can overcome you","hi":"तो तुम पर कोई ग़ालिब आने वाला नहीं"},"ref":"47:11"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"وَالسَّاعَةُ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالسَّاعَةُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَيْبَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span>","hinglish":"Aur qayamat, us mein koi shak nahin","translations":{"ur":"جس کی اس کے پاس کوئی دلیل نہیں","en":"For which he has no proof","hi":"जिसकी उसके पास कोई दलील नहीं"},"ref":"45:32"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"لَا حُجَّةَ بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَكُمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حُجَّةَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْن</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَبَيْنَكُمُ</span>","hinglish":"Hamare aur tumhare darmiyan koi daleel nahin","translations":{"ur":"اس دن مجرموں کے لیے کوئی خوشخبری نہیں ہوگی","en":"There are no good tidings that Day for the criminals","hi":"उस दिन मुजरिमों के लिए कोई ख़ुशख़बरी नहीं होगी"},"ref":"42:15"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"لَا ظُلْمَ الْيَوْمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا ظُلْمَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْيَوْمَ</span>","hinglish":"Aaj koi zulm nahin","translations":{"en":"And that the disbelievers have no protector","ur":"اور یہ کہ کافروں کا کوئی مولیٰ (مددگار) نہیں","hi":"और यह कि काफ़िरों का कोई मौला (मददगार) नहीं"},"ref":"40:17"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"لَهُ الْمُلْكُ لَا إِلٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَهُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مُلْكُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلٰهَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَّا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هُوَ</span>","hinglish":"Uski badshahat hai, uske siwa koi ilah nahin","translations":{"ur":"ہمیں آج جالوت کے مقابلے کی کوئی طاقت نہیں","en":"We have no power today against Goliath","hi":"हमें आज जालूत के मुक़ाबले की कोई ताक़त नहीं"},"ref":"39:6"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"إِنَّ السَّاعَةَ لَآتِيَةٌ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّاعَةَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">آتِيَةٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَيْبَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak qayamat aane wali hai, us mein koi shak nahin","translations":{"ur":"حج میں نہ کوئی بے حیائی کی بات ہو، نہ نافرمانی اور نہ جھگڑا","en":"There is no obscenity and no wickedness and no disputing during Hajj","hi":"हज में न कोई बेहयाई की बात हो, न नाफ़रमानी और न झगड़ा"},"ref":"40:59"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s13","sentence_number":13,"arabic":"لَا بُشْرَى يَوْمَئِذٍ لِلْمُجْرِمِينَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بُشْرَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَوْمَئِذٍ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِلْمُجْرِم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ِينَ</span>","hinglish":"Us din mujrimon ke liye koi khushkhabri nahin","translations":{"en":"Unquestionably, they are the liars","ur":"بلاشبہ وہی لوگ جھوٹے ہیں","hi":"बिला-शुब्हा वही लोग झूठे हैं"},"ref":"25:22"},{"id":"s2l8_v12_s14","sentence_number":14,"arabic":"لَا تَبْدِيلَ لِكَلِمَاتِ اللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَبْدِيلَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِكَلِم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َاتِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Allah ki baaton ke liye koi tabdeeli nahin","translations":{"ur":"آج اللہ کے حکم سے کوئی بچانے والا نہیں","en":"There is no protector today from the decree of Allah","hi":"आज अल्लाह के हुक्म से कोई बचाने वाला नहीं"},"ref":"10:64"}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_lbl13","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Q-2 Darj zail alfaaz se pehle (لَا) laga kar inki mukammal nafi kijiye aur unhein dobara likhiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_g14","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l8_g14_w1","arabic":"طَاقَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">طَاقَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Taqat / Bardasht","translations":{"en":"No fear","ur":"کوئی خوف نہیں","hi":"कोई ख़ौफ़ नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w2","arabic":"شَرِيكٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">شَرِيكٌ</span>","hinglish":"Shareek","translations":{"en":"No injustice","ur":"کوئی ظلم نہیں","hi":"कोई ज़ुल्म नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w3","arabic":"عِلْمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Ilm","translations":{"en":"No knowledge","ur":"کوئی علم نہیں","hi":"कोई इल्म नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w4","arabic":"فُسُوقٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فُسُوقٌ</span>","hinglish":"Fasik hona / Gunah","translations":{"en":"No god / deity","ur":"کوئی معبود نہیں","hi":"कोई माबूद नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w5","arabic":"إِكْرَاهٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِكْرَاهٌ</span>","hinglish":"Zabardasti","translations":{"en":"No partner","ur":"کوئی شریک نہیں","hi":"कोई शरीक नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w6","arabic":"خَيْرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Bhalai","translations":{"en":"No good","ur":"کوئی بھلائی نہیں","hi":"कोई भलाई नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w7","arabic":"بُشْرَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بُشْرَى</span>","hinglish":"Khushkhabri","translations":{"en":"No power / strength","ur":"کوئی طاقت نہیں","hi":"कोई ताक़त नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w8","arabic":"غَالِبٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">غَالِبٌ</span>","hinglish":"Ghalib","translations":{"en":"No compulsion","ur":"کوئی زبردستی نہیں","hi":"कोई ज़बरदस्ती नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w9","arabic":"جَرَمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">جَرَمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Shak","translations":{"en":"No proof","ur":"کوئی دلیل نہیں","hi":"कोई दलील नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w10","arabic":"تَبْدِيلٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">تَبْدِيلٌ</span>","hinglish":"Tabdeeli","translations":{"en":"No glad tidings","ur":"کوئی خوشخبری نہیں","hi":"कोई ख़ुशख़बरी नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w11","arabic":"إِلٰهٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلٰهٌ</span>","hinglish":"Mabood / Ilah","translations":{"en":"No protector","ur":"کوئی مددگار (مولیٰ) نہیں","hi":"कोई मददगार (मौला) नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w12","arabic":"ظُلْمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ظُلْمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Zulm","translations":{"en":"No capability","ur":"کوئی طاقت (وسعت) نہیں","hi":"कोई ताक़त (वुसअत) नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w13","arabic":"مُبَدِّلٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مُبَدِّلٌ</span>","hinglish":"Badalne wala","translations":{"en":"No dispute","ur":"کوئی جھگڑا نہیں","hi":"कोई झगड़ा नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w14","arabic":"عَاصِمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَاصِمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Bachane wala","translations":{"en":"No doubt","ur":"کوئی شک نہیں","hi":"कोई शक नहीं"}},{"id":"s2l8_g14_w15","arabic":"رَيْبٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَيْبٌ</span>","hinglish":"Shak","translations":{"en":"Then no sin","ur":"تو کوئی گناہ نہیں","hi":"तो कोई गुनाह नहीं"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s2l8_g15","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Kisi bhi zubaan ke jumle samajhne ke liye alfaaz ka jaanna zaroori hai. Bohat se Qur'ani alfaaz seekhne ke baad, ab aap chhote Qur'ani jumle samajhne ke qaabil ho rahe hain. Jaise jaise aap jumle samajhna shuru karenge, zubaan ke qawaid-o-zawabit (Grammar) qudrati taur par khud-ba-khud samajh aane lagenge."}}]}}